    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 5 11]\ntheorem erdos_42 : answer(sorry) ↔\n    ∀ M ≥ 1, ∀ᶠ N in atTop, ∀ (A : Set ℕ) (_ : IsMaximalSidonSetIn A N),\n    ∃ᵉ (B : Set ℕ), B ⊆ Set.Icc 1 N ∧ IsSidon B ∧ B.ncard = M ∧\n    ((A - A) ∩ (B - B)) = {0}",
